#     `:focus-visible` outline in `base.css` marks it; the `relative z-10` that lifts the focused
#     cell above its neighbours stays.
#   A11Y-2: `dropdown_root` gains `h-full min-h-6`. With `captionLayout="dropdown"` the real
#     `<select>` is `absolute inset-0` of that root, which upstream sizes from the caption's 20px
#     line box — a 20px-tall pointer target. The dropdowns row is already `h-(--cell-size)`, so
#     filling it costs no layout. This is the A11Y-2 audit the exception map asks for on `calendar`.
#   cn: `import { cn } from "cn"` becomes `@vegastack/design` — our npm layer owns `cn` (DOC-2).
#   formatting: the repository formatter (prettier defaults: semicolons, trailing commas)
#               reflows the file, and `registry-stamp.mjs` writes the provenance header the
#               three-copy model needs (DOC-1); those hunks carry no decision of their own.
